jpg","https://assets.lcsc.com/images/lcsc/900x900/20250807_YAGEO-RC0603FR-0747KL_C105579_back.jpg","https://assets.lcsc.com/images/lcsc/900x900/20250807_YAGEO-RC0603FR-0747KL_C105579_blank.jpg"],"edaSvgInfo":{"schSvg":"//image.easyeda.com/component_svgs/prod/fd3c1f33783d4bceb1ae7423afad3e48.svg?t=1706529664","pcbSvg":"//image.easyeda.com/component_svgs/prod/398691f1f785460098bbe5ee6590333c.svg?t=1706529664"},"faqs":[{"question":"What are the fundamental resistance ratings, tolerance limits, and temperature coefficients of the RC0603FR-0747KL?","answer":"The YAGEO RC0603FR-0747KL is a general-purpose thick film surface-mount resistor with a nominal resistance of 47 kΩ. In the part number, \"F\" indicates a ±1% resistance tolerance, while \"R\" denotes paper tape and reel packaging. The resistor has a Temperature Coefficient of Resistance (TCR) of ±100 ppm/°C."},{"question":"Which maximum power dissipation limits and working voltage thresholds constrain circuit design?","answer":"The RC0603FR-0747KL is rated for 0.1 W (100 mW, 1/10 W) at 70°C. It has a maximum continuous working voltage of 75 V, a maximum overload voltage of 150 V, and a dielectric withstanding voltage of 150 V."},{"question":"What standardized package dimensions and board space requirements define this component?","answer":"The resistor is supplied in a 0603 surface-mount package with nominal body dimensions of 1.60 ± 0.10 mm × 0.80 ± 0.10 mm and a height of 0.45 ± 0.10 mm. Its external terminations feature a nickel barrier with a matte tin finish for lead-free assembly."},{"question":"What operating temperature range and environmental characteristics define this component?","answer":"The RC0603FR-0747KL is specified for operation over a temperature range of −55°C to +155°C. It is constructed on a high-grade ceramic substrate with a glass-covered thick film resistive element and a protective epoxy overcoat. The device is classified as Moisture Sensitivity Level (MSL) 1."},{"question":"What packaging and assembly characteristics support high-volume SMT manufacturing?","answer":"The \"07\" ordering code specifies 7-inch (178 mm) paper tape reel packaging. For the RC0603 package, a standard 7-inch reel contains 5,000 pieces. The resistor features lead-free matte tin terminations and complies with RoHS requirements."}],"pdfUrl":"https://datasheet.lcsc.com/datasheet/pdf/b426be3ce22c6de3e0c3a2248e49159e.pdf?productCode=C105579","authenticationList":["ROHS3 认证"],"isRohsCert":true,"rohsCertType":"ROHS3","rohsCertList":[{"fileCode":"wj1598927","fileName":"YAGEO(国巨)_贴片电容_X6S系列_ROHS认证.pdf","url":"https://datasheet.lcsc.com/certification/rohs/7231f3cca6980a4791d39cd2bf4e90cb.pdf"},{"fileCode":"wj1831512","fileName":"全量通用_ROHS认证_YAGEO(国巨).pdf","url":"https://datasheet.lcsc.com/certification/rohs/880d4dd55fe33a5c283e5964fb88da1d.pdf"},{"fileCode":"wj1851664","fileName":"全量通用_ROHS认证_YAGEO(国巨)@@Brightking(君耀电子).pdf","url":"https://datasheet.lcsc.com/certification/rohs/b66f8cddf95c82a86c072e3fb0621167.pdf"}],"productDescEn":null,"productIntroEn":"100mW 47kΩ 75V Thick Film Resistor ±100ppm/℃ ±1% 0603 Chip Resistor - Surface Mount RoHS","paramVOList":[{"paramCode":"param_10837_n","paramName":"功率","paramNameEn":"Power(Watts)","paramValue":"100mW","paramValueEn":"100mW","paramValueEnForSearch":0.1,"isMain":true,"sortNumber":1,"sort":20},{"paramCode":"param_11205_n","paramName":"阻值","paramNameEn":"Resistance","paramValue":"47kΩ","paramValueEn":"47kΩ","paramValueEnForSearch":47000.0,"isMain":true,"sortNumber":1,"sort":7},{"paramCode":"param_11204_n","paramName":"最大工作电压","paramNameEn":"Voltage Rating","paramValue":"75V","paramValueEn":"75V","paramValueEnForSearch":75.0,"isMain":true,"sortNumber":1,"sort":18},{"paramCode":"param_11202","paramName":"电阻类型","paramNameEn":"Type","paramValue":"厚膜电阻","paramValueEn":"Thick Film Resistor","paramValueEnForSearch":-1.0,"isMain":true,"sortNumber":1,"sort":1},{"paramCode":"param_11185_s","paramName":"温度系数","paramNameEn":"Temperature Coefficient","